# This project keeps its images and PDFs in git. A global gitignore may ignore
# these file types; re-include them here (a repo .gitignore overrides the global
# core.excludesFile). This only affects this repository.
!*.jpg
!*.JPG
!*.jpeg
!*.JPEG
!*.png
!*.PNG
!*.webp
!*.pdf
